Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; PC Remote - lift the WebDAV client limits so Windows Explorer can map the
; app as a network drive and read/write files bigger than 50 MB.
; Double-click this file, accept the prompt, then restart the "WebClient"
; service (or reboot) for the change to take effect.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\WebClient\Parameters]
"FileSizeLimitInBytes"=dword:ffffffff
"BasicAuthLevel"=dword:00000002
